      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZOUBABY (2) goes well for hoop Moor who has two wins and four placings from just nine steers and strikes a very winnable contest here. Has placed three from three over this track and trip and will be rock-hard fit for this contest. Should be right there when the whips are cracking. MOULIN MISS (4) has two wins and two seconds from six spins around this circuit and gets the reliable Gollan/Lang combination. Racing very consistently of late and can make her presence felt. FLEETWOOD (1) strips fitter second-up from the spell and gets 3kg weight relief from the inside alley. Ticks a few boxes. BIANCELLI (5) saves her best form for this sprint journey and rates a genuine top-three candidate on best figures. BLAKEMORE AVENUE (6) best of the rest.",
